AuthAndResolveRecipientTest
├── when caller is the position owner
│ └── it returns the requested recipient
├── when caller is token-approved
│ └── it returns the owner (operator cannot redirect)
├── when caller is approved-for-all
│ └── it returns the owner (operator cannot redirect)
└── when caller is a stranger
    └── it reverts with {NotAuthorizedForToken}
